    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815590/extras/39cfd565f8795c982f4e9eccb8598058.poster.avif?t=1751063984\" width=800 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815590/extras/39cfd565f8795c982f4e9eccb8598058.webm?t=1751063984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815590/extras/39cfd565f8795c982f4e9eccb8598058.mp4?t=1751063984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced wave-survival shooter with roguelite progression. Command a small ship and blast hordes of enemies with mouse-aimed weapons. Upgrade your stats to survive and push back the abyss.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Core Loop</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced shooting.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 handcrafted waves.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP, level-up, choose an upgrades kill the enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815590/extras/39f3e13a03295a5272669e63976caee3.poster.avif?t=1751063984\" width=726 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815590/extras/39f3e13a03295a5272669e63976caee3.webm?t=1751063984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815590/extras/39f3e13a03295a5272669e63976caee3.mp4?t=1751063984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Tips</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep moving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your upgrades count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget the cannons.</p></li></ul>",
