"bb_paragraph\" >Keep moving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your upgrades count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget the cannons.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Abyssal Tides is a fast-paced naval bullet-hell roguelite\u2014pilot a sloop, stack upgrades mid-battle, and fend off 30 handcrafted enemy waves to save the world from the Void. Leap over rolling swells and crush your foes with arrows and cannon fire to rekindle humanity\u2019s hope.",
